# control.proto / filter.proto

These two files are vendored from the **waywallen** project
(https://github.com/hypengw/waywallen), which is MIT licensed:

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2026 hypengw

They are compiled by `build.rs` (prost) to provide the wallpaper-entry /
filter data model used by the wrapper in `src/wp/proto.rs`. No protocol
endpoint from that project is used: Wallpaper Hub talks to its own kernel over
the JSON control plane in `crates/we-native`.

Changes from upstream: none. If you update them, keep the field names intact —
the UI's scanning code constructs these structs directly.
